READ
  1. WHY THE METRIC ENDS, quantified: v_g/c_s = 1.34 at x = 2 and
     grows without bound — ξ-scale excitations outrun the acoustic
     cone, so the emergent causal structure cannot describe them.
  2. WHAT AN EXCITATION BECOMES: the coherence factors give the
     particle content continuously — collective phonon (v² ≫ 1) to
     bare medium quantum (v² → 0) — with quasiparticle number
     conserved. The 'radiation-like energy conserved in the medium'
     leg of the reconstruction now has its microscopic form.
  3. THE DOOR IS A QUENCH for modes x ≲ 2.5: their frequencies
     are slower than the door's own rate, so they cross suddenly and
     get squeezed — the door CREATES quanta in the long-wavelength
     medium bath. A computed (modest) energy-injection channel at the
     boundary, relevant to the reheat ledger.
  4. SCOPE: medium sector only. The Standard-Model sector's crossing
     (photons at the boundary) is the remaining corner — its own task.
